  Light Consumption's first effect, as a Maneuver: a Clash (Corporeal vs Corporeal/Impulsive) at an Opponent with Power - won, their Power yours as Light Stacks.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round, Resource]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 2 Actions, target an Opponent who meets any conditions from the list below. Make a Clash (Corporeal vs Corporeal/Impulsive) against that Opponent. If you win, apply the effects listed below:

---

# At an Opponent with stacks of Power (or in a Transformation, the table's till Transformations exist) - the Clash (chat.mjs lightConsume).
[on used]
lightConsume();
